WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:02.736
Preparing to defend against

00:00:02.736 --> 00:00:04.404
a second gigantic attack,

00:00:04.404 --> 00:00:06.506
even as they're already under assault

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:07.607
by Russia.

00:00:07.607 --> 00:00:09.876
Ukrainian units held large scale drills

00:00:09.876 --> 00:00:11.945
to prepare for bigger battles to come

00:00:14.014 --> 00:00:15.849
The head of Ukraine's Joint Forces

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:17.550
Command tells me

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:19.085
we need to know what exactly

00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:20.553
to prepare the forces for

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:22.655
and how they should be prepared, he says.

00:00:22.922 --> 00:00:26.159
That's why this is so important.

00:00:26.693 --> 00:00:29.429
We're in the Chernobyl exclusion zone,

00:00:29.429 --> 00:00:30.497
site of the worst

00:00:30.497 --> 00:00:32.699
nuclear disaster in history.

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:33.900
Ukraine's special forces

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:35.969
also practicing urban combat

00:00:35.969 --> 00:00:37.670
in the abandoned buildings.

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:38.071
The U.S.

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:38.638
and its allies

00:00:38.638 --> 00:00:39.406
believe the Russians

00:00:39.406 --> 00:00:41.041
could mount a massive offensive

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:41.941
once the spring comes.

00:00:41.941 --> 00:00:43.009
That's why the Ukrainians

00:00:43.009 --> 00:00:44.577
are getting their forces ready,

00:00:44.577 --> 00:00:45.512
even as they're already

00:00:45.512 --> 00:00:46.479
fighting the Russians

00:00:46.479 --> 00:00:49.682
on several fronts in this country.

00:00:49.949 --> 00:00:51.651
The Ukrainians say that to win,

00:00:51.651 --> 00:00:54.320
they need more modern Western weapons,

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:56.790
especially main battle tanks.

00:00:56.790 --> 00:00:58.691
Yeah, just in terms of quality,

00:00:58.691 --> 00:01:00.260
of course, there's a big difference,

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:01.261
the general says,

00:01:01.261 --> 00:01:02.462
because the fire control

00:01:02.462 --> 00:01:04.230
systems of Western equipment

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:06.332
are far superior to Russian weapons.

00:01:08.101 --> 00:01:09.335
As the battles in places

00:01:09.335 --> 00:01:10.637
like Bermuda in eastern

00:01:10.637 --> 00:01:11.604
Ukraine remain

00:01:11.604 --> 00:01:13.740
brutal and casualties mount.

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:15.742
Ukraine's leadership says it's grateful

00:01:15.742 --> 00:01:17.977
for the massive military aid announced

00:01:17.977 --> 00:01:19.546
at the wrong time meeting.

00:01:19.546 --> 00:01:21.281
But Kiev is disappointed

00:01:21.281 --> 00:01:22.615
Germany still hasn't

00:01:22.615 --> 00:01:23.783
signed off on sending

00:01:23.783 --> 00:01:25.819
Leppard to main battle tanks,

00:01:26.019 --> 00:01:27.287
which would be key to help them

00:01:27.287 --> 00:01:28.321
turn the tide.

00:01:28.321 --> 00:01:30.957
A top presidential adviser tells me

00:01:30.957 --> 00:01:31.891
about the new boot.

00:01:31.891 --> 00:01:33.526
Our guys won't leave the battlefield,

00:01:33.526 --> 00:01:34.260
even if they aren't

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:36.262
provided with new equipment, he says.

00:01:36.262 --> 00:01:37.764
But more of them will die.

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:38.865
This must stop.

00:01:38.865 --> 00:01:39.299
We want

00:01:39.299 --> 00:01:41.101
our people to have a better chance

00:01:41.101 --> 00:01:43.303
of saving their own lives.

00:01:43.303 --> 00:01:44.237
The Ukrainians say

00:01:44.237 --> 00:01:44.838
the new aid

00:01:44.838 --> 00:01:45.672
announced Friday

00:01:45.672 --> 00:01:47.207
will go a long way to help them

00:01:47.207 --> 00:01:48.475
beat Russia back.

00:01:48.475 --> 00:01:50.543
And the Halo padlock says he hopes

00:01:50.543 --> 00:01:51.044
the U.S.

00:01:51.044 --> 00:01:52.712
and its allies will keep weapons

00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:54.247
flowing in the long run.

00:01:54.247 --> 00:01:55.215
But it's a fluke.

00:01:55.215 --> 00:01:55.982
But the most

00:01:55.982 --> 00:01:57.350
I think our allies have the perfect

00:01:57.350 --> 00:01:58.952
understanding of the price we're paying,

00:01:58.952 --> 00:01:59.652
he says.

00:01:59.652 --> 00:02:00.720
That it's very important

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:01.921
for Russia to lose.

00:02:01.921 --> 00:02:03.990
They understand the nature of this war

00:02:04.023 --> 00:02:05.425
the nature of Russia

00:02:05.425 --> 00:02:06.993
and why it is impossible

00:02:06.993 --> 00:02:08.695
to negotiate with them, not only

00:02:08.695 --> 00:02:09.362
to receive

00:02:11.731 --> 00:02:12.799
the Ukrainians say

00:02:12.799 --> 00:02:13.133
they need

00:02:13.133 --> 00:02:14.400
to grasp the initiative

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:15.435
before the Russians

00:02:15.435 --> 00:02:17.470
can recover from their losses.

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:18.638
And they're gearing up for

00:02:18.638 --> 00:02:22.475
what could be a brutal spring.

00:02:23.343 --> 00:02:23.710
But, Jake,

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:25.612
the Ukrainians also say there is a whole

00:02:25.612 --> 00:02:27.247
nother facet to this as well.

00:02:27.247 --> 00:02:27.981
They say they're having

00:02:27.981 --> 00:02:29.015
increasing problems

00:02:29.015 --> 00:02:30.917
getting spare parts for their Soviet

00:02:30.917 --> 00:02:32.886
era tanks and ammunition as well.

00:02:32.886 --> 00:02:33.453
So on the one

00:02:33.453 --> 00:02:35.121
hand, those modern Western tanks

00:02:35.121 --> 00:02:36.923
would be for better capabilities.

00:02:36.923 --> 00:02:39.225
But it's also about staying in the fight,

00:02:39.325 --> 00:02:40.827
especially as that Russian offensive

00:02:40.827 --> 00:02:41.728
looms Jake.

00:02:41.728 --> 00:02:41.995
All right.

00:02:41.995 --> 00:02:43.329
Fred Pleitgen in Kiev, Ukraine,

00:02:43.329 --> 00:02:43.863
thanks so much.

00:02:43.863 --> 00:02:45.098
Let's talk about this with William

00:02:45.098 --> 00:02:47.167
Cohen, former Republican senator

00:02:47.167 --> 00:02:48.868
from Maine and defense secretary

00:02:48.868 --> 00:02:50.336
in the Clinton administration.

00:02:50.336 --> 00:02:51.237
Secretary Cohen,

00:02:51.237 --> 00:02:52.172
thanks so much for joining us.

00:02:52.172 --> 00:02:54.140
To start with the tank standoff.

00:02:54.140 --> 00:02:54.807
Germany's defense

00:02:54.807 --> 00:02:56.242
minister says there are both good

00:02:56.242 --> 00:02:57.243
and bad reasons

00:02:57.243 --> 00:02:57.944
for giving Ukraine

00:02:57.944 --> 00:02:59.212
the lever to tanks

00:02:59.212 --> 00:03:01.214
that they're desperately asking for.

00:03:01.214 --> 00:03:02.282
Why do you think Germany is

00:03:02.282 --> 00:03:03.249
so hesitant here?

00:03:04.984 --> 00:03:06.186
Well, I think part of it is

00:03:06.186 --> 00:03:07.587
political

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:09.055
and certainly emotional on the part

00:03:09.055 --> 00:03:10.323
of the the Germans.

00:03:10.323 --> 00:03:11.891
We don't give Germany enough credit

00:03:11.891 --> 00:03:13.693
for what they've been doing

00:03:13.693 --> 00:03:14.227
and the amount

00:03:14.227 --> 00:03:15.061
they're contributing,

00:03:15.061 --> 00:03:16.896
both in materiel and equipment

00:03:16.896 --> 00:03:18.264
and now money.

00:03:18.264 --> 00:03:19.499
So I think

00:03:19.532 --> 00:03:21.668
anyone who's trying to divide Germany

00:03:21.668 --> 00:03:22.202
and separate

00:03:22.202 --> 00:03:23.970
them out is being not a good ally.

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:24.871
They're wrong.

00:03:24.871 --> 00:03:26.406
Germany is a great ally.

00:03:26.406 --> 00:03:28.575
The problem is that they've got a history

00:03:28.908 --> 00:03:30.243
and they have another issue,

00:03:30.243 --> 00:03:31.211
not only their history,

00:03:31.211 --> 00:03:33.446
but I don't think they want to be seen

00:03:33.446 --> 00:03:34.480
as being the country

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:36.749
that's triggering any kind of escalation.

00:03:36.983 --> 00:03:38.384
And if there's going to be an escalation,

00:03:38.384 --> 00:03:38.785
they want

00:03:38.785 --> 00:03:40.887
all of us to be involved in that.

00:03:40.887 --> 00:03:42.355
And so I don't think it's unreasonable

00:03:42.355 --> 00:03:44.257
for them to say we'll put our

00:03:44.257 --> 00:03:46.159
our best main battle tank there,

00:03:46.159 --> 00:03:47.594
but we want you to have yours

00:03:47.594 --> 00:03:48.361
there as well.

00:03:48.361 --> 00:03:50.296
Even though the capabilities

00:03:50.296 --> 00:03:51.164
are quite different,

00:03:51.164 --> 00:03:52.232
even though it doesn't

00:03:52.232 --> 00:03:53.433
necessarily translate

00:03:53.433 --> 00:03:54.934
into more effectiveness.

00:03:54.934 --> 00:03:57.270
Symbolically, it's really important.

00:03:57.570 --> 00:03:59.239
I hope that they're able to work

00:03:59.239 --> 00:04:00.073
this out.

00:04:00.073 --> 00:04:02.308
Secretary of Defense Austin has said

00:04:02.575 --> 00:04:03.710
we're still working it

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:04.677
and I hope to do it

00:04:04.677 --> 00:04:06.446
quickly because time is of the essence.

00:04:06.446 --> 00:04:08.514
But I would say whatever it takes

00:04:08.648 --> 00:04:09.816
to get the Leppard's there,

00:04:09.816 --> 00:04:12.218
if it takes some Abrams ago,

00:04:12.218 --> 00:04:13.786
I would say do it. So.

00:04:13.786 --> 00:04:15.121
So if you are secretary of defense

00:04:15.121 --> 00:04:16.656
right now, you would say

00:04:16.656 --> 00:04:18.157
send two or three Abrams

00:04:18.157 --> 00:04:18.958
tanks over there.

00:04:18.958 --> 00:04:20.093
If that's what the German I mean,

00:04:20.093 --> 00:04:22.395
if that's what the Germans need as cover,

00:04:22.395 --> 00:04:24.931
even if I mean, they really need a lot.

00:04:25.131 --> 00:04:26.733
It sounds like the Ukrainians are saying

00:04:26.733 --> 00:04:27.500
we need dozens

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:29.102
if not hundreds of the leopard two,

00:04:29.102 --> 00:04:31.004
which are more agile than the Abrams.

00:04:32.939 --> 00:04:33.940
They're more agile.

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:35.541
They're more modern.

00:04:35.541 --> 00:04:37.543
They use a fuel,

00:04:37.543 --> 00:04:40.980
which is easily obtained and need the

00:04:41.147 --> 00:04:43.349
the fuel from the Abrams

00:04:43.349 --> 00:04:44.984
is basically jet fuel.

00:04:44.984 --> 00:04:45.718
They have to have

00:04:45.718 --> 00:04:48.121
you have a whole supply chain problem.

00:04:48.121 --> 00:04:49.022
With the Abrams.

00:04:49.022 --> 00:04:51.257
But I would say under the circumstances,

00:04:51.991 --> 00:04:53.293
what they need are tanks.

00:04:53.293 --> 00:04:54.294
And we can help

00:04:54.294 --> 00:04:56.329
get the Germans to say, it's okay

00:04:56.329 --> 00:04:57.864
if you're in it, we're in it.

00:04:57.864 --> 00:04:59.432
I think that's the most important

00:04:59.432 --> 00:05:01.000
thing, is saving Ukraine

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:02.368
from Russian

00:05:02.368 --> 00:05:04.170
extermination as such with

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:05.705
what the Russians are doing.

00:05:05.705 --> 00:05:08.041
They are engaged not only in

00:05:08.041 --> 00:05:09.942
what they call de-Nazification

00:05:09.942 --> 00:05:11.744
deep population of Ukraine.

00:05:11.744 --> 00:05:13.112
They are annihilating

00:05:13.112 --> 00:05:14.747
the people of Ukraine.

00:05:14.747 --> 00:05:16.082
So anything we can do

00:05:16.082 --> 00:05:17.550
to prevent more of that slaughter

00:05:17.550 --> 00:05:19.385
from taking place, we ought to do it.

00:05:19.385 --> 00:05:21.287
And if it's a question we're providing,

00:05:21.287 --> 00:05:22.989
something is not that combat

00:05:22.989 --> 00:05:24.857
effective under the circumstances.

00:05:24.857 --> 00:05:26.159
Let's do it anyway

00:05:26.159 --> 00:05:29.896
so we can get the Germans to to satisfy

00:05:29.896 --> 00:05:31.531
their local political problems,

00:05:31.531 --> 00:05:32.332
which are real,

00:05:32.332 --> 00:05:33.700
and we ought to address them.

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:36.302
If Ukraine does not get these tanks

00:05:36.302 --> 00:05:37.670
and the other heavy weaponry

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:38.671
that they're requesting,

00:05:38.671 --> 00:05:40.306
long range missiles,

00:05:40.306 --> 00:05:41.074
how do you see their fight

00:05:41.074 --> 00:05:41.941
against the Russians

00:05:41.941 --> 00:05:43.409
going forward in the next few months,

00:05:43.409 --> 00:05:45.011
especially if there's a spring offensive?

00:05:46.279 --> 00:05:47.680
Well, if

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:49.215
it's a war of attrition

00:05:49.215 --> 00:05:50.416
at this particular point

00:05:50.416 --> 00:05:51.651
and what the Russians are doing,

00:05:51.651 --> 00:05:52.652
you're trying to

00:05:52.652 --> 00:05:54.821
just destroy the will, obviously.

00:05:54.821 --> 00:05:56.956
But the the means of survival

00:05:56.956 --> 00:05:57.990
in terms of heat,

00:05:57.990 --> 00:06:01.094
electricity, water, food, energy, etc..

00:06:01.327 --> 00:06:02.462
So what they're trying to do

00:06:02.462 --> 00:06:04.764
is wear down the Ukrainians.

00:06:04.764 --> 00:06:06.332
And this is a war of attrition

00:06:06.332 --> 00:06:08.368
then we have to give whatever

00:06:08.368 --> 00:06:11.604
the Ukrainians need to take the battle

00:06:11.604 --> 00:06:13.172
against the Russians

00:06:13.172 --> 00:06:15.041
and to defeat them on the ground.

00:06:15.041 --> 00:06:15.875
And the notion

00:06:15.875 --> 00:06:17.276
that the Russians are saying, well,

00:06:17.276 --> 00:06:18.878
if we lose on the ground

00:06:18.878 --> 00:06:20.513
on a conventional basis,

00:06:20.513 --> 00:06:22.415
we may use nuclear weapons.

00:06:22.415 --> 00:06:23.783
Well, they've said that before.

00:06:23.783 --> 00:06:24.417
And that's something

00:06:24.417 --> 00:06:26.085
we have to be concerned about.

00:06:26.085 --> 00:06:28.755
But you can't have Russia wrap itself

00:06:29.021 --> 00:06:31.624
in a nuclear jacket

00:06:32.492 --> 00:06:33.960
and threaten to blow itself up

00:06:33.960 --> 00:06:34.861
in the rest of the world.

00:06:34.861 --> 00:06:36.262
That's simply

00:06:36.496 --> 00:06:38.030
not going to happen, in my opinion.

00:06:38.030 --> 00:06:39.332
But we can't have the world

00:06:39.332 --> 00:06:40.366
standing by

00:06:40.366 --> 00:06:41.768
terrified that

00:06:41.768 --> 00:06:43.136
they're putting on this vest

00:06:43.136 --> 00:06:44.270
and saying we're going to blow

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:45.872
not only Ukraine up,

00:06:45.872 --> 00:06:47.240
but much of the world.

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:47.940
Well, that's just it.

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:48.307
The Russian

00:06:48.307 --> 00:06:49.675
minister of foreign affairs

00:06:49.675 --> 00:06:51.310
issued the warning about the increase

00:06:51.310 --> 00:06:51.978
supply of weapons

00:06:51.978 --> 00:06:53.179
to the west, saying, quote,

00:06:53.179 --> 00:06:54.781
We regard all this

00:06:54.781 --> 00:06:56.115
as an open,

00:06:56.115 --> 00:06:57.483
provocative incitement

00:06:57.483 --> 00:06:58.651
by the West and an increase

00:06:58.651 --> 00:06:59.952
in the stakes in the conflict,

00:06:59.952 --> 00:07:02.054
which will inevitably lead to an increase

00:07:02.054 --> 00:07:03.289
in casualties in a

00:07:03.289 --> 00:07:05.024
and the dangerous escalation

00:07:05.024 --> 00:07:05.658
Do you think there's

00:07:05.658 --> 00:07:07.360
an actual red line here for Russia?

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:08.494
Because they've been saying

00:07:08.494 --> 00:07:09.162
that sort of thing

00:07:09.162 --> 00:07:10.096
from the very beginning.

00:07:10.096 --> 00:07:11.030
And every time the U.S.

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:12.965
in the West gets incrementally involved,

00:07:12.965 --> 00:07:13.666
every time they say,

00:07:13.666 --> 00:07:15.067
well, that's the line, that's the line.

00:07:15.067 --> 00:07:16.469
But do you think there's an actual line?

00:07:18.137 --> 00:07:19.639
There may be.

00:07:19.705 --> 00:07:21.674
And we can't, you know,

00:07:21.674 --> 00:07:23.376
not take that into account.

00:07:23.376 --> 00:07:25.244
But if we're going to allow the Russians

00:07:25.244 --> 00:07:28.448
to say, if we don't win, the world loses.

00:07:28.748 --> 00:07:29.415
And that's

00:07:29.415 --> 00:07:30.750
what they're saying to us

00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:33.453
and to the rest of Western democracies

00:07:33.453 --> 00:07:34.120
and much of the world,

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:37.657
there are 54 countries in Rammstein

00:07:37.924 --> 00:07:39.792
right now. That's more than needle.

00:07:39.792 --> 00:07:41.828
That's a lot more than narrow, though.

00:07:41.861 --> 00:07:42.862
The world is now

00:07:42.862 --> 00:07:43.529
looking at this

00:07:43.529 --> 00:07:44.597
in terms of the Russians

00:07:44.597 --> 00:07:46.966
have engaged in an act,

00:07:46.966 --> 00:07:47.767
a war crime

00:07:47.767 --> 00:07:49.802
by invading a neutral country.

00:07:49.802 --> 00:07:50.636
And now they're saying

00:07:50.636 --> 00:07:51.404
if we don't

00:07:51.404 --> 00:07:53.873
take possession of our little beauty

00:07:54.207 --> 00:07:55.942
then we're going to blow the world up.

00:07:55.942 --> 00:07:57.109
We can't accept that.

00:07:57.109 --> 00:07:58.711
And we have to tell the Russians

00:07:58.711 --> 00:07:59.812
there'll be

00:07:59.812 --> 00:08:00.880
a terrible penalty

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:02.215
that you will pay the day.

00:08:02.215 --> 00:08:03.049
You ever think about

00:08:03.049 --> 00:08:04.650
using a nuclear weapon

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:06.652
in this battle or any other.

00:08:06.652 --> 00:08:07.620
But we can't afford

00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:10.022
to have an extortion being

00:08:10.022 --> 00:08:11.657
waged against the United States saying

00:08:11.657 --> 00:08:13.826
either you let us win or allow

00:08:13.826 --> 00:08:14.760
all of these Ukrainian

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:16.863
to be slaughtered day after day,

00:08:16.863 --> 00:08:17.864
or else we might

00:08:17.864 --> 00:08:20.933
pull our nuclear button out and destroy

00:08:21.767 --> 00:08:24.036
much of Europe and much of whether

00:08:24.036 --> 00:08:26.506
India, China or the Middle East.

00:08:27.106 --> 00:08:28.107
There's no end to it

00:08:28.107 --> 00:08:29.775
once you start down the nuclear

00:08:30.810 --> 00:08:31.244
path.

00:08:31.244 --> 00:08:33.412
So I think we have to tell them

00:08:33.412 --> 00:08:35.214
