You violated the law

00:08:36.916 --> 00:08:38.784
and you are causing world

00:08:38.784 --> 00:08:40.086
economic problems

00:08:40.086 --> 00:08:42.021
and you're putting us on a path of

00:08:42.021 --> 00:08:43.189
