00:08:43.189 --> 00:08:44.790
With the rest of the world.

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:46.359
Now's the time to settle this.

00:08:46.359 --> 00:08:48.561
And that would be get out of Ukraine.

00:08:48.728 --> 00:08:50.229
And I think we have to take

00:08:50.229 --> 00:08:51.831
give them give the Ukrainians

00:08:51.831 --> 00:08:52.732
what they need

00:08:52.732 --> 00:08:54.867
